msgid "To run the \"gdb\" binary from $PATH, leave this field empty. To run a custom gdb, for example, for a different architecture, enter the executable name here. You can either run gdb from $PATH, but with a different name (say, \"arm-gdb\"), by typing the name here, or by specifying the full path to a gdb executable."
